## Implement Linear Search

📌 What is Linear Search?
   Check each element one by one until you find the value you are looking for.


arr = [10, 25, 30, 45, 50]
target = 30

found = False

for i in range(len(arr)):
    if arr[i] == target:
        print("Element found at index:", i)
        found = True
        break

if found == False:
    print("Element not found")
